    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Well, my good days are exactly like the bad ones",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"My bitch say that I defy the laws of attraction",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I've always been terrified of endin' up normal (Normal)",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Things that we all search for end up findin' us",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"God is like the school bell, He gon' tell you when your time is up",
          "rhyme":"9p",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Shit just end up workin' out, why do we wonder why it does? (Why it does)",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Yeah, so I asked God to take me on a perfect day",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Swear I saw Him cryin', don't know why everyone sure it's rain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Education system, but I feel we only learn from change",
          "rhyme":"#Z",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Every time I think about it, shit just starts to hurt my brain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Problems we can't solve always seem to be my favorite ones",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Life just gets so boring, playing superhero makes it fun (Fun)",
          "rhyme":"yn",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"But why is \"heroism\" so close to \"heroin\"? (Heroin)",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGHIHAJH",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCDEFGHIHADH"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"chorus",
      "performer":", ",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"We are what we believe in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"There is no such thing as freedom",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"But what can we do?",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"What can we do?",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"'Cause I see the light at the end of the tunnel (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"It feels like I'm dyin', dyin' (Yeah), dyin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I'm dead",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCCDAE",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCCDAD"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"They tell you that you need to sleep, and suddenly you do",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Scared you gonna wake up as someone who isn't you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"We've all been down that road before, poured alcohol on open sores",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Nobody can hurt me if I go inside and close the door",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Not scared of growin' old and dyin', feel this where the answer lives",
          "rhyme":"iv",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"You wear the garments, everybody needs to dress some manikins (Manikins)",
          "rhyme":"in",
